{'symbol': 'T', 'date': '2019-11-03 22:30:00', 'title': 'AT&T MAKES AT&T OFFICE@HAND A LEAD OFFER FOR UNIFIED COMMUNICATIONS AS A SERVICE SOLUTIONS', 'text': 'AT&T IS EXPANDING ITS RELATIONSHIP WITH RINGCENTRAL, INC. MAKING AT&T OFFICE@HAND A LEAD OFFER FOR UCAAS SOLUTIONS AS PART OF ITS BROAD VOICE AND COLLABORATION PORTFOLIO. BASED ON THE RINGCENTRAL® PLATFORM, AT&T OFFICE@HAND BRINGS EXTENSIVE MOBILE-FIRST VOICE, VIDEO, ONLINE MEETINGS, MESSAGING AND TEAM COLLABORATION CAPABILITIES TO BUSINESSES AND VERTICAL SECTORS WORLDWIDE. IN ADDITION, AT&T AND RINGCENTRAL PLAN TO JOINTLY DEVELOP CAPABILITIES AND TECHNOLOGIES THAT WILL FURTHER INTEGRATE WITH AT&T’S NETWORK. AT&T OFFICE@HAND WILL ALSO FEATURE ENHANCED INTEGRATION WITH MICROSOFT TEAMS, AND WILL BE A KEY PIECE IN COMPREHENSIVE OFFERS LIKE AT&T SD-WAN AND AT&T SD-WAN NOW THAT OPTIMIZE VOICE AND VIDEO QUALITY TO ENABLE COST-EFFECTIVE ENTERPRISE DEPLOYMENTS FOR DISTRIBUTED LOCATIONS.'}